    35→<a href="https://fly.io/"><img width=14px src="./.github/logos/flyio.small.ico"/> Fly.io </a>,
    36→<a href="https://tur.so/sqlite-vec"><img width=14px src="./.github/logos/turso.small.ico"/> Turso</a>,
    37→<a href="https://sqlitecloud.io/"><img width=14px src="./.github/logos/sqlitecloud.small.svg"/> SQLite Cloud</a>, and
    38→<a href="https://shinkai.com/"><img width=14px src="./.github/logos/shinkai.small.svg"/> Shinkai</a>.
    39→See <a href="#sponsors">the Sponsors section</a> for more details.
    40→</i>
    41→</p>
